Package: tarr.pop
Type: Package
Title: Population data staorage and retrieval for Texas counties.
Version: 0.0.0.9229
Description: A package for retrieving and manipulating population data.
    Data is stored on disk in multidimensional arrays or cubes. Operations
    use delayed evaluation, and then selected results can be retrieved into 
    memory such as an array, data frame or tibble. Contains population 
    figures for all of the counties in Texas. Data sources include the U.S. 
    Census Bureau decennial census and population estimates, ACS population 
    estimates by ZIP Code Tabulation Area, Texas Demographic Center estimates 
    and projections, and National Cancer Institute SEER population estimates 
    and standard populations used for adjustments. Select ACS data to be 
    added with empahsis on Tarrant County
